{"id":"5a0b601b375ead95","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-implicanttruebound.md","title":"A quadratic bound in the number of true points","display":"thm-implicanttruebound — A quadratic bound in the number of true points","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-implicanttruebound","aliases":["27-thm-implicanttruebound"],"display":"thm-implicanttruebound — A quadratic bound in the number of true points","depends_on":["[[27-df-impset]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-pointhull]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.2.1 Corollary 3.1","source_printed_pages":"129","source_pdf_pages":"153","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-implicanttruebound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-implicanttruebound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-implicanttruebound — A quadratic bound in the number of true points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" href=\"?note=f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" title=\"27-df-pointhull\">27-df-pointhull</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.2.1 Corollary 3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"129"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"153"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}\">\\(T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=|T|\">\\(m=|T|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Hull}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" href=\"?note=f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" title=\"27-df-pointhull\">27-df-pointhull</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\subseteq\\{\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)\\mid y,z\\in T\\},\\qquad|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\le|\\mathrm{Imp}(f)|\\le\\binom m2+m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\subseteq\\{\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)\\mid y,z\\in T\\},\\qquad|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\le|\\mathrm{Imp}(f)|\\le\\binom m2+m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个一致项都有真点；若它是 f 的蕴涵项，任选其中一个点并取该项内的对跖点，就把它表示为两个真点的 hull。Hull 对交换两点不变，故只需数无序点对及重复点，共 m(m+1)/2 个。该界依赖真点数；当真点列表很短时比仅用变量数的 3^n 界有用。f=0 时 m=0、蕴涵项族为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-impset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pointhull","status":"resolved","id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pointhull]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}$、$m=|T|$。$\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]、[[27-df-piset]]；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}$、$m=|T|$。$\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]、[[27-df-piset]]；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pointhull","status":"resolved","id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}$、$m=|T|$。$\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]、[[27-df-piset]]；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m=|T|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\subseteq\\{\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)\\mid y,z\\in T\\},\\qquad|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\le|\\mathrm{Imp}(f)|\\le\\binom m2+m.","display":true}],"bytes":1696,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-implicanttruebound|thm-implicanttruebound — A quadratic bound in the number of true points]]"}],"outgoing":["e9e30bad3bbd56ff","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","f81148ddb9a8ee2f"]}